{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A traffic light runs repeatedly through the following cycle: green for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> seconds, then yellow for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> seconds, and then red for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> seconds. Leah picks a random three-second time interval to watch the light. What is the probability that the color changes while she is watching?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb936f6a90994c11f4b4c8e396dafbd5f1d22d6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{63} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{21} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{10} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{7} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"388\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The traffic light runs through a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> second cycle.\n</p><p>Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a607fd61885c014512c949fee18869690330407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=0$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> reference the moment it turns green, the light changes at three different times: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0722c452ffbd2ce78ac00cfd13f628514bab13d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=30$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a114f05cc3c2a18ac7023d2f1736dd9764731a7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb45c1cf012c05141f04c2396a0c1ada90fcfcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=63$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>This means that the light will change if the beginning of Leah's interval lies in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/d/fed247ea7f8c97f0f1ded70f012592db772169a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[27,30]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec3d9f67ec329c02168e5579090fe14df62de947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[30,33]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83cfa74157bcba9f5ccdeaba2515a13d5bb7acd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[60,63]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This gives a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> seconds out of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/e/4be2aec3932acf4aacfb77ce925de5cb6e9c9d1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{63} = \\frac{1}{7} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"114\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Prob